{"repositoryId":1384998846,"availability":"available","full":"lonewolfyx/github-unlimited-orgs","name":"github-unlimited-orgs","description":":octocat: Show all GitHub organizations for any user — API + browser extension + Tampermonkey script","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":6,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T07:55:32Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:24:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github-unlimited-orgs.vercel.app","topics":[],"demo":"https://github-unlimited-orgs.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.467Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.467Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.467Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T11:46:11.467Z","stars":6,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Show every organization on any GitHub profile — not just the first few.","Expand the collapsed +N more / View all avatar list with native hover cards, powered by a self-hosted API."],"features":["🔍 Full organization list — GitHub only exposes a handful of avatars and hides the rest behind +N more. This project loads the complete list for any user.","👤 Smart routing — detects the signed-in user's own profile (View all / /settings/organizations) and other users' profiles (+N more) and serves each through the optimal channel.","⚡ No data loss — your own profile is served from GitHub's intercepted /side-panels/user.json response, with a request–replay mechanism so data is never lost to injection timing.","🪝 Native hover cards — injected avatars keep the original data-hovercard-url attribute, so GitHub's hover cards work exactly as expected.","🔁 SPA-aware — survives GitHub's soft navigation (turbo:load, pjax:end, popstate) and self-heals when a re-render strips the injected avatars."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lonewolfyx/github-unlimited-orgs/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"7f818eedb0c658aef9cd1021a10bb360caa3f6bb1a020beb3ded0be693750f36","e